      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Entity matching - the task of clustering duplicated database records to underlying entities.\n\n“Given a large collection of records, cluster these records so that the records in each cluster all refer to the same underlying entity. “\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entity matching - the task of clustering duplicated database records to underlying entities.\n\n“Given a large collection of records, cluster these records so that the records in each cluster all refer to the same underlying entity. “\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 74,
      "index": "a2",
      "autoResize": true
    },
