      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Challenges: industrial application at scale\n\n- Provide entity cluster at multiple confidence level, enable downstream apps with varying \nprecision/recall tradeoff needs.\n\n- Customer attributes systematically missing, incomplete, and conflicting \n\n- Assign persistent cluster IDs with daily updates\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "UD0OJ2Lb72dwmmZmHUgpk",
      "originalText": "Challenges: industrial application at scale\n\n- Provide entity cluster at multiple confidence level, enable downstream apps with varying precision/recall tradeoff needs.\n\n- Customer attributes systematically missing, incomplete, and conflicting \n\n- Assign persistent cluster IDs with daily updates\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 175,
      "index": "a4",
      "autoResize": true
    },
