      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "2. Resolving Conflicts in Clustering\n\nBad-Triplet problem i.e., (r1, r2) match, (r1, r3) match, but (r2, r3) non-\nmatch..\n- Agreeable-triplet: information systematically missing from a source \n- Disagreeable-triplet: conflicting information",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "zidgFeulI-DeL8ZooODqd",
      "originalText": "2. Resolving Conflicts in Clustering\n\nBad-Triplet problem i.e., (r1, r2) match, (r1, r3) match, but (r2, r3) non-match..\n- Agreeable-triplet: information systematically missing from a source \n- Disagreeable-triplet: conflicting information",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "baseline": 124,
      "index": "aG",
      "autoResize": true
