      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1759149562848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Pairwise record matching is a supervised binary classification problem:\ni.e,    f(x) = y, x= [r1, r2], y is {True, False}\n\nFraming Entity-Matching As an Ordinal Regression Problem:\ni.e.,    f(x) = y, x= [r1, r2], y is [1, 2, 3, ..., K], K=5\n\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pairwise record matching is a supervised binary classification problem:\ni.e,    f(x) = y, x= [r1, r2], y is {True, False}\n\nFraming Entity-Matching As an Ordinal Regression Problem:\ni.e.,    f(x) = y, x= [r1, r2], y is [1, 2, 3, ..., K], K=5\n\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 135,
      "index": "aY",
      "autoResize": true
    },
