      "updated": 1759149562848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Algorithm for finding the best mapping:\n    - Problem is identical to finding the maximum-weight matchings in bipartite graphs \n(assignment problem)\n    - Rule out a brute force search\n    - Well-known Hungarian algorithm with an O(n3) \n    - A greedy approximation algorithm + linear performance O(n) + distributed \nalgorithm",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "WxxkZa8weo14NG1JJ6cSJ",
      "originalText": "Algorithm for finding the best mapping:\n    - Problem is identical to finding the maximum-weight matchings in bipartite graphs (assignment problem)\n    - Rule out a brute force search\n    - Well-known Hungarian algorithm with an O(n3) \n    - A greedy approximation algorithm + linear performance O(n) + distributed algorithm",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 135,
      "index": "ah",
      "autoResize": true
    },
