      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Fusion architecture runs in the cloud atop infrastructure as a service (IaaS). \n\u000bThe entire entity matching pipeline is implemented on Apache Spark for high throughput and scalability.\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fusion architecture runs in the cloud atop infrastructure as a service (IaaS). \n\u000bThe entire entity matching pipeline is implemented on Apache Spark for high throughput and scalability.\n",
