      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "\"As a Data Analyst, \n\nI want to develop a method to identify and \nmatch customers who have different IDs \nacross our multiple brands, \n\nso that we can create a unified customer view \nand improve our cross-brand marketing \nstrategies.\"",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "yQdLdIx8gB1YajETgYxJK",
      "originalText": "\"As a Data Analyst, \n\nI want to develop a method to identify and match customers who have different IDs across our multiple brands, \n\nso that we can create a unified customer view and improve our cross-brand marketing strategies.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 219,
      "index": "ar",
      "autoResize": true
    },
